    "All 25,340 candidate slots are evaluated; 16,331 are accepted and 10 productively selected in the active baseline.",
    "The embedded 167 profile timestamps independently reproduce block weights 23/39/39/40/26.",
    "Window calibration SNR under an independent-bin assumption is roughly 10-12x the single-bin candidate SNR, but the fully-correlated limit is close to the single-bin SNR. Apparent window precision gain is therefore strongly dependence-model contingent.",
